units metal
atom_style atomic
dimension 3
boundary p p f
lattice bcc 3.3
region projectile block 0 20 0 20 0 20
region target block 0 20 0 20 20 60
region simbox union 2 projectile target
create_box 1 simbox
create_atoms 1 region projectile
create_atoms 1 region target
displace_atoms region projectile move 0 0 -1.5
change_box all z final 0 61.5
pair_style eam/alloy
pair_coeff * * ../../../potentials/prompt1.potential Nb
neighbor 2 bin
neigh_modify every 1 delay 0 check yes
velocity all create 300 4928459 mom yes rot yes dist gaussian
group projectile region projectile
group target region target
velocity projectile set 0 0 2000 sum yes
fix nvt_eq all nvt temp 300 300 0.1
timestep 0.001
run 100000
unfix nvt_eq
fix nve all nve
run 100000
